        "quote": "The claim that this creates a sweeping Federal surveillance database \nis completely and totally false. Data sharing would be highly targeted. \nIt requires an explicit--explicit--written request from the U.S. \nAttorney General for the purpose of investigating and prosecuting \ncrime.",
        "summary": "The claim that this creates a sweeping Federal surveillance database is completely and totally false. Data sharing would be highly targeted. It requires an explicit--explicit--written request from the U.S. Attorney General for the purpose of investigating and prosecuting crime.",
