        "summary": "The legislation explicitly mandates full compliance--yes, read it. It is in there. It mandates full compliance with the Privacy Act of 1974 and with HIPAA regulations. The Federal Government cannot and will not simply hoard this data, as was suggested. The bill requires strict encryption, tightly restricted access, and permanent destruction of shared records once an investigation concludes.",
