        "summary": "True compassion means ensuring that the limited Federal benefits that are so stretched--and it is going to be tough over the next couple of years. We want to make sure that money actually reaches the people who need it. Every dollar stolen by a fraudster is a dollar taken away from some senior, child, or family.",
